   |	            ^
18 |	

-- reserved-helper-clash/divergence --
suite: check-backend
case: invalid/extern-header-helper-clash/main.tck
go: Go's newHeader reports an extern func's C name that tack.h reserves at
  the func's name, not at the extern("...") C name it is about.
why: The port reports it at the C name, as the type checker reports a C
  name C cannot declare, decided by the language owner 2026-11-15.
same: none
